  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "めのまえの　ものに　すぐに　かみつく\nしゅうせい。　はえかけの　まえばが\nかゆいので　かみついてしまうらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "눈앞에 있는 것은 바로 물어버리는\n습성을 가졌다. 나고 있는 앞니가\n근질거려서 물게 된다는 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "有著不管看到什麼都會咬上去\n的習性。這似乎是因為長門牙\n的時候會癢的緣故。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a pour habitude de mordre tout ce qui lui passe\nsous les yeux. On raconte qu’il fait cela parce que\nses incisives qui poussent le démangent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schnappt sofort nach allem, was ihm\nunterkommt. Der Grund dafür ist anscheinend,\ndass seine wachsenden Vorderzähne jucken.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muerde todo lo que se le ponga por delante.\nAl parecer, lo hace para aliviar el dolor que\nsiente cuando le crecen los incisivos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Addenta tutto ciò che gli capita davanti. Sembra\nche lo faccia d’istinto, a causa del prurito\nprovocato dagli incisivi che stanno crescendo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apparently the itch of its teething impels it to\nsnap its jaws at anything in front of it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "目の前の　ものに　すぐに　噛みつく\n習性。　生えかけの　前歯が\n痒いので　噛みついてしまうらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "有着不管看到什么都会咬上去\n的习性。这似乎是因为长门牙\n的时候会痒的缘故。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muerde todo lo que se le ponga por delante.\nAl parecer, lo hace para aliviar el dolor que\nsiente cuando le crecen los incisivos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　ツノは　いわの　かたさ。\nツノで　たたかい　ひるんだ　すきに\nパクリと　かみつき　はなさない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리 뿔은 바위처럼 단단하다.\n뿔로 싸우다가 풀이 죽은 틈에\n덥석 물고 놓지 않는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用頭上硬如岩石的角攻擊敵人。\n趁其不備之時大口咬住對方，\n一旦咬住便再也不會鬆口。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La corne sur sa tête est aussi dure que la roche.\nIl s’en sert pour se battre et lorsque l’ennemi\nflanche, il le mord et ne le lâche plus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Kampf greift es mit dem steinharten Horn auf\nseinem Kopf an. Schreckt der Gegner zurück,\nschnappt es zu und lässt nicht wieder los.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El cuerno que tiene en la cabeza es duro como\nuna roca. Lo usa para atacar al rival y, cuando\neste baja la guardia, lo muerde y no lo suelta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Per attaccare usa il corno sulla testa, che è duro\ncome la pietra. Quando il nemico è indebolito,\nlo morde e non molla più la presa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard\nhorn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this\nPokémon bites down and never lets go.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　ツノは　岩の　硬さ。\nツノで　戦い　ひるんだ　隙に\nパクリと　噛みつき　離さない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用头上硬如岩石的角攻击敌人。\n趁其不备之时大口咬住对方，\n一旦咬住便再也不会松口。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El cuerno que tiene en la cabeza es duro como\nuna roca. Lo usa para atacar al rival y, cuando\neste baja la guardia, lo muerde y no lo suelta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきな　まえばは　まだ　はえかけ。はが　かゆいときは　なかまの　ツノにパクリと　かみつき　じゃれあう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "커다란 앞니는 난 지 얼마 되지 않았다. 이빨이 가려울 때는 동료의 뿔을 덥석 물면서 장난을 친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大大的門牙還未長全。牙齒癢的時候會和夥伴們大口咬住彼此的角來玩。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son incisive continue à pousser. Lorsqu’elle le démange, il joue avec un de ses congénères et lui mord la corne.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Juckt sein noch im Wachstum befindlicher großer Vorderzahn, schnappt es nach dem Horn eines Artgenossen und tobt mit diesem herum.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su gran incisivo no le ha terminado de salir. Cuando le molesta, juguetea con uno de sus compañeros mordisqueándole el cuerno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
